    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>**Requires a DX12 compatible GPU**</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A passion project years in the making.</strong></h2><br>With big inspiration from older tactical games but having the freedom to break all of the rules (and walls), <strong>EVOTACTICS</strong> aims to evolve the third person shooter genre with unique ideas, game modes, and gameplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25b6</strong>FULLY NETWORKED DESTRUCTION</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549540/extras/b4f6ca080d2f2af0fcec168ba952f6f7.poster.avif?t=1723639483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549540/extras/b4f6ca080d2f2af0fcec168ba952f6f7.webm?t=1723639483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549540/extras/b4f6ca080d2f2af0fcec168ba952f6f7.mp4?t=1723639483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Destruction in <strong>EVOTACTICS</strong> is <i>fully networked across player's machines</i>.   Use a variety of special explosives to create your own entry points for you and your team.  Utilizing explosives is just one way to get around a problem.  EVOTACTICS is designed to be able to handle very large destructible environments.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25b6</strong>LIGHTS OUT</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549540/extras/2d0fc28bc579ae0057a362ec3a7c1ebe.poster.avif?t=1723639483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549540/extras/2d0fc28bc579ae0057a362ec3a7c1ebe.webm?t=1723639483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2549540/extras/2d0fc28bc579ae0057a362ec3a7c1ebe.mp4?t=1723639483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Breaking lights allows you to use the shadows to your advantage.   Lights block vision while using night vision goggles.  Pick and choose the lights you kill for strategic reasons.",
